   "text": "\"pk_rel is opened in RowShareLock mode since that's what\nour eventual SELECT FOR KEY SHARE will get on it\"",
   "originalText": "\"pk_rel is opened in RowShareLock mode since that's what\nour eventual SELECT FOR KEY SHARE will get on it\"",
